            ((v1 shr 7) and 1) shl 31 or ((v1 shr 15) and 1) shl 30 or
            ((v1 shr 23) and 1) shl 29 or ((v1 shr 31) and 1) shl 28 or
            ((v0 shr 7) and 1) shl 27 or ((v0 shr 15) and 1) shl 26 or
            ((v0 shr 23) and 1) shl 25 or ((v0 shr 31) and 1) shl 24 or
            ((v1 shr 5) and 1) shl 23 or ((v1 shr 13) and 1) shl 22 or
