            ((v0 shr 5) and 1) shl 19 or ((v0 shr 13) and 1) shl 18 or
            ((v0 shr 21) and 1) shl 17 or ((v0 shr 29) and 1) shl 16 or
            ((v1 shr 3) and 1) shl 15 or ((v1 shr 11) and 1) shl 14 or
